===Head to the Vortex of Genesis and recall what came before{{subst:void|<!--104040101-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Vortex of Genesis|Since arriving in Amphoreus, each meeting and parting has come in dazzling succession, leaving behind a faint melancholy. Even the ever-spirited (Trailblazer) now stands within the Vortex of Genesis, immersed in memories.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|undefined}} Collect your thoughts
:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} "Strife"...
::The Lance of Fury once became the Mad King, plunging the world into ceaseless strife, until your valor brought it to an end.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} "Time"...
::Back then, the Incarnation of Time entrusted Mem to you at the Temple of the Three Fates. Back then, the lively girl with red hair fulfilled her mission, and bid the first farewell.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} "Reason"...
::Not long ago, the head of the Grove Sages helped you repel the menace that is the black tide.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} "Death"...
::The prophecy once made the Hand of Shadow choose two people, granting one the fate of death. Yet their bond wove a hauntingly beautiful tale that stretched across time.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What a long journey it's been...
::Time and again, farewells haven't numbed you. You can't help but wonder &mdash; how many more goodbyes will the journey of "Trailblazing" entail? You question whether you'll be able to express each "goodbye" with heartfelt emotion.
::{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

