:'''Mem:''' ...Styxia's moonlight is so beautiful.
:'''Mem:''' And the River of Souls is so quiet... It's like everything that happened was just a dream. I wonder if Cas is doing okay on the other side? If I write a letter and put it in a drift bottle, will she be able to read it?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I miss Castorice too...
::'''Mem:''' No. No! This shouldn't be so depressing!
::'''Mem:''' Now's not the time to feel down. We gotta pull ourselves together!
::Now's not the time to feel down.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Now's not the time to feel down.
:'''Mem:''' ... You're right. We promised Cas that we'd continue the Flame-Chase Journey, so we can't let her worry.
:'''Mem:''' Now's not the time to feel down. We gotta pull ourselves together!
:'''Mem:''' By the way, it was Miss Cipher who asked us to come here, but where has she gone...?
:'''Mem:''' ...Huh?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's that sound?
::'''Mem:''' I don't know, but this aura... feels so familiar.
::Is there someone else here?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is there someone else here?
:'''Mem:''' Yes, and this aura... feels so familiar.
:'''Mem:''' ... (Trailblazer), let's go check it out together. Be very careful...
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Investigate the source of the strange noise{{subst:void|<!--104040105-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:'''Mem:''' Hey, what's that on the ground? Should we pick it up...?
:'''Mem:''' Careful... Careful...
:'''Mem:''' It's... a piece of black cloth?
:'''Mem:''' Now, where have I seen this before...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's the Flame Reaver...
::'''Mem:''' Wh&mdash;What? How could they be here?
::Did someone rip off a piece of my clothes?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did someone rip off a piece of my clothes?
:'''Mem:''' Wha&mdash; No. Your clothes are perfectly fine!
:'''Mem:''' Could this be from... the Flame Reaver's cloak!? Why is it here?
:'''Mem:''' Mem! Memi!!!
:'''Mem:''' &mdash; (Trailblazer), look out!
:'''Flame Reaver:''' ...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mem, get ready &mdash;
::'''Mem:''' Wait! We both know what this thing can do...
::You want the pink puppy, don't you?
::'''Mem:''' I &mdash; What? Now I'm sad! This isn't the time for jokes &mdash;
