:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You want the pink puppy, don't you?
::'''Mem:''' I &mdash; What? Now I'm sad! This isn't the time for jokes &mdash;
::Is it finally time... for me to bow out?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is it finally time... for me to bow out?
:'''Mem:''' D&mdash;Don't give up just like that!
:'''Mem:''' Let's try our best to deal with them for now, and we'll slip into the past with Time's power as soon as we can!
:'''Flame Reaver:''' ...
:'''Flame Reaver:''' The River of Souls...
:'''Flame Reaver:''' Is full of fish... Big and delicious.
:'''Mem:''' What.
:'''Flame Reaver:''' ...
:'''Flame Reaver:''' The Flame-Chase Journey... stops...
:'''Flame Reaver:''' Meow... meow...
:'''Mem:''' M&mdash;Meow?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...What's happening?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is this meant to be a riddle?
::'''Mem:''' I&mdash;I don't understand this language at all. Am I hallucinating...?
::The Flame Reaver's gone mad. The end.
::'''Mem:''' W&mdash;We already knew about the mad part! But are we still in danger...?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Flame Reaver's gone mad. The end.
::'''Mem:''' W&mdash;We already knew about the mad part! But are we still in danger...?
:'''Flame Reaver:''' Hehehe... hehehehehe...
:'''Flame Reaver:''' ...Hehehahahahahahha!
:'''Cipher:''' Ahahahahaha... Sorry. I couldn't pass on the chance to give you two a good scare!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So it's you! Cipher!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What a terrible person. Let's leave.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This Cipher must be fake too. Run!
:'''Cipher:''' Ah! Don't run! I'm the real Cipher! The real one!
:'''Cipher:''' C'mon, don't be upset. I'm just giving you a kind reminder that Amphoreus isn't safe at all. The whole place is full of dangers, including that swordmaster... Make sure you stay on your toes, no matter where you are!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So you're playing both good cop and bad cop.
::'''Cipher:''' Hey, I'm just making it up to you. You'd do the same in my shoes.
::Well, ain't I grateful for the reminder.
::'''Cipher:''' Hey, I'm just making it up to you. You're not gonna hold that over me, are you?
::I'm so strong that I don't need your reminder.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Well, ain't I grateful for the reminder.
::'''Cipher:''' Hey, I'm just making it up to you. You're not gonna hold that over me, are you?
::I'm so strong that I don't need your reminder.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm so strong that I don't need your reminder.
:'''Cipher:''' Really? But just a minute ago that gray hair of yours was all standing up, you were so scared.
:'''Mem:''' So... was that a Flame Reaver disguise? Or a magic trick? It looked so real... Is that the power of the Trickery demigod?
:'''Cipher:''' Disguise? No no no, it's not as simple as that. Lemme think about how to explain this...
:'''Cipher:''' For example, what did you think when you realized that piece of cloth came from the Flame Reaver's cloak?
:'''Mem:''' Hmm... We thought that maybe the Flame Reaver was around here somewhere?
:'''Cipher:''' That's right. And then you heard some footsteps. What did you think when that happened?
:'''Mem:''' Well, we thought it must be the Flame Reaver coming this way...?
:'''Cipher:''' Yep, exactly. I just used some hints and mental suggestions to help you believe in a lie...
:'''Cipher:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|"Lies" are what Zagreus is best at. If everyone believes in a lie, then it becomes reality!}}
:'''Mem:''' A power to make lies into reality... That's got all my hairs standing up!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Nice! Now I know your secret!
::'''Cipher:''' I sure love your arrogance, Gray Mystery~
::And... you're just telling us everything like that?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And... you're just telling us everything like that?
:'''Cipher:''' You think I might be lying? Pfft. No need.
:'''Cipher:''' The seamstress trusts you for a reason. Someone as honest as you couldn't trick me even if you wanted to, so there's no harm in telling you.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

